## TargetingTemplateApi

### Create targeting templates
## Create targeting templates
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/targeting_templates
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "auto_targeting_enabled": "<string>",
 "keywords": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "placement_group": "<string>",
 "targeting_attributes": "<string>",
 "tracking_urls": "<string>"
}


### List targeting templates
## List targeting templates
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/targeting_templates?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&includeSizing={{includeSizing}}&searchQuery={{searchQuery}}
Accept: application/json

### Update targeting templates
## Update targeting templates
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/targeting_templates
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "id": "<string>",
 "operation_type": "<string>",
 "targeting_attributes": "<string>"
}

